{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": "markdown",
   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "# oxilite studio: a company knowledge graph\n\nThis notebook runs against the demo's **Project store**: `data/people.ttl`, the ontology in `ontology/`, and the rules in `rules/org.dl`, with **OWL 2 RL** reasoning (see `oxilite.toml`). Run a cell with the ▶ next to it; results are saved in the notebook.",
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "markdown",
   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "## Who is a person?\n\nNo triple says `a ex:Person`. The ontology says managers are employees and employees are persons, and `ex:worksFor` has the domain `ex:Employee`, so OWL 2 RL infers the rest.",
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "code",
   "language": "sparql",
   "value": "PREFIX ex: <https://example.org/>\n\nSELECT ?person ?name ?salary WHERE {\n  ?person a ex:Person .\n  OPTIONAL { ?person ex:name ?name }\n  OPTIONAL { ?person ex:salary ?salary }\n}\nORDER BY DESC(?salary)",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "title": "cell 1",
     "payload": {
      "elapsedMs": 0.375458,
      "kind": "solutions",
      "rows": [
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/ada"
        },
        {
         "datatype": {
          "termType": "NamedNode",
          "value": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
         },
         "language": "",
         "termType": "Literal",
         "value": "Ada Lovelace"
        },
        {
         "datatype": {
          "termType": "NamedNode",
          "value": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
         },
         "language": "",
         "termType": "Literal",
         "value": "120000"
        }
       ],
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/bob"
        },
        {
         "datatype": {
