    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "markdown",
   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "## Chains of command, with Datalog\n\n`rules/org.dl` derives `ex:reportsTo` recursively. A program with a goal runs like a query.",
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "code",
   "language": "datalog",
   "value": "@prefix ex: <https://example.org/> .\n\nchain(?who, ?boss) :- ex:reportsTo(?who, ?boss).\n\n?- chain(?who, ?boss).",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "title": "cell 2",
     "payload": {
      "elapsedMs": 0.148125,
      "kind": "solutions",
      "rows": [
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/eve"
        },
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/bob"
        }
       ],
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/eve"
        },
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/ada"
        }
       ],
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/bob"
        },
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/ada"
        }
       ],
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/cyd"
        },
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/ada"
        }
       ]
      ],
      "truncated": false,
      "variables": [
       "who",
       "boss"
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "markdown",
   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "## The same organisation as a property graph\n\nCypher labels and relationship types resolve to the data's own namespace. Switch the result to **graph**.",
