   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "## A graph you can see\n\nCONSTRUCT results draw as a graph too. Inferred `reportsTo` edges come from the rules.",
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "code",
   "language": "sparql",
   "value": "PREFIX ex: <https://example.org/>\n\nCONSTRUCT {\n  ?e ex:reportsTo ?m .\n  ?e ex:worksFor ?c .\n} WHERE {\n  ?e ex:reportsTo ?m .\n  OPTIONAL { ?e ex:worksFor ?c }\n}",
