  {
   "kind": "markdown",
   "language": "markdown",
   "value": "## Who breaks the rules?\n\n`ex:PersonShape` wants every person to have a name. `ex:eve` has none: the Problems panel shows it on her line in `data/people.ttl`. The same check as a query:",
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "code",
   "language": "sparql",
   "value": "PREFIX ex: <https://example.org/>\n\nSELECT ?person WHERE {\n  ?person a ex:Person .\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?person ex:name ?n }\n}",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "title": "cell 3",
     "payload": {
      "elapsedMs": 0.204042,
      "kind": "solutions",
      "rows": [
       [
        {
         "termType": "NamedNode",
         "value": "https://example.org/eve"
        }
       ]
      ],
      "truncated": false,
      "variables": [
       "person"
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
